{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#card-zh","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-if 是一个面向 DSH Web 客户端的条件式 /if 命令插件。它先让当前会话使用的模型依据既有上下文判断条件，再决定是否把后续指令作为普通用户消息交给主 agent；默认与消息队列集成，也可切换为后台模式。判断优先使用继承上下文的 fork 子代理，并提供文本记录回退方式。配置页可切换判断方式，适合希望按对话状态有条件推进任务的 DSH 用户。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1126","lib/index.js:580-612","lib/client.js:274-307"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#card-en","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-if adds a conditional /if command to DSH. The session model checks prior context and sends the following instruction only when the condition holds. It joins the normal message queue by default, with an optional background mode. A settings page selects the mode.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1126","lib/index.js:580-612","lib/client.js:274-307"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#intent-1","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"想让 DSH 先根据聊天上下文确认条件，再决定是否继续执行指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1126","lib/index.js:102-107"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#intent-2","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"我想把条件满足时才发送的任务放进 DSH 普通消息队列。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1126","lib/index.js:102-107"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#intent-3","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"能不能让模型判断上一轮是否达成目标，达成后再发下一步？","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1126","lib/index.js:102-107"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#intent-4","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"intent","lang":"zh","text":"希望用一个斜杠命令按对话状态触发后续提示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1126","lib/index.js:102-107"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#intent-5","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"I want DSH to send a follow-up instruction only when a condition in the conversation is met.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1126","lib/index.js:102-107"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#intent-6","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"intent","lang":"en","text":"Can I queue a conditional prompt that the session model checks before the next turn?","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1126","lib/index.js:102-107"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#feature-1","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-if 的功能「条件成立才发送」：模型根据当前会话上下文判断条件，只有 YES 时才把后续指令作为普通用户消息送给主 agent；条件不成立则不发送。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:102-107","lib/index.js:1043-1066"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#feature-2","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-if 的功能「排队式 /if 命令」：用户输入条件和指令后，插件把 /if 原文加入普通消息队列；回合开始时判断，并在条件成立时将该队列消息替换为指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1088-1116","lib/index.js:1010-1075"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#feature-3","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-if 的功能「判断模式设置」：用户可在插件设置页选择默认的普通消息队列模式或后台模式，配置默认值为 message。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:59-68","lib/client.js:274-307"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#feature-4","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-if 的功能「多行条件输入」：/if 后首行作为条件，后续行作为指令；需要多行条件时可用单独一行 --- 分隔条件与指令。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:4-12","lib/index.js:238-270"]}
{"unit_id":"TLEWA__dsh-if#caveat-1","repo":"TLEWA/dsh-if","commit":"541f92667a8094f5f392814ffd0b8fdf4705aa30","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-if 使用当前会话的模型提供方来判断条件，判断请求包含会话记录与待判断条件；判断内容会发送到该会话所配置的模型服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:823-839"]}
